- `crates/storage/src/node_client.rs:6298-6369` - Response validation checks route, object fields, matches_request, and only bucket/key/version_id for each part; it does not validate ObjectPartRecord.data_pg_id.
- `crates/storage/src/metadata_command.rs:630-659` - CommitMultipartObjectCommand::matches_request compares part number, size, etag, shard identifiers, EC shape, and checksum, but not data_pg_id.
