- `crates/storage/src/pg_store.rs:7236-7280` - Accepted CommitMultipartObject commands are applied and pass command.parts into multipart object persistence.
- `crates/storage/src/pg_store.rs:10347-10381` - PgStore inserts part.data_pg_id into the object_parts manifest.
- `crates/storage/src/pg_store.rs:15543-15555` - Object part reads load data_pg_id from object_parts, so the accepted bad value affects future reads.
